{"seq":3,"slug":"grammatical-relations","title":"语法关系","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"argument-structure","title":"论元结构与题元角色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations/argument-structure","wordCount":1578,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"case-agreement","title":"格与一致关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations/case-agreement","wordCount":1907,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"agreement-binding","title":"一致性与约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations/agreement-binding","wordCount":1880,"readingTime":8},{"seq":4,"slug":"voice-case-systems","title":"语态与格系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations/voice-case-systems","wordCount":1979,"readingTime":8},{"seq":5,"slug":"complex-sentences","title":"复杂句式与从属关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/morphology-syntax/grammatical-relations/complex-sentences","wordCount":1976,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"语法关系-简介\">语法关系 简介</h1><p>本章深入探讨句子内部各成分之间的语法功能关系，从论元结构到格系统再到复杂句式，帮助读者理解语法关系如何组织句子的意义表达。</p>\n<p><strong>论元结构与题元角色</strong>讲解动词对论元的选择限制，介绍施事、受事、经验者等题元角色的分配规则和论元结构的表示方法。</p>\n<p><strong>格与一致关系</strong>分析语法格在标记名词短语句法功能中的作用，讲解主语与动词之间的一致关系以及格的形态实现方式。</p>\n<p><strong>复杂句式与从属关系</strong>探讨复合句和复杂句的结构组织，包括并列关系、从属连接、关系从句和补足语从句的句法分析方法。</p>\n<p>建议读者结合多种语言的实例进行语法关系分析，注重理论与语言事实之间的对应关系。</p>\n"}